{"name":"Agile Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"agile-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>An item or weapon carried by the robot is launched up to 20 feet into the air; you Interact to catch it.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"agile-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"30258d039511f199"}
{"name":"Imitator Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"imitator-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Focuses on a target within the first range increment or reach; your damaging Strikes against it make it @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} until the start of your next turn.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"imitator-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"856c25ae775d5d86"}
{"name":"Powerful Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"powerful-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Until the start of your next turn, your Strikes that damage creatures within the robot companion&#39;s melee reach also deal 1d6 persistent bleed damage (2d6 if burly or deft).</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e-missing-tech-pets.robot-support.Item.5540938c40c07162]</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"powerful-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"87bc6d0235fa5929"}
{"name":"Surveillance Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"surveillance-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Until the end of your next turn, creatures adjacent to the robot can’t flank you or make you @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard}.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"surveillance-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"489a73fded65ca9c"}
{"name":"Tank Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"tank-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next Strike against a foe within the robot’s melee reach; it ends after the Strike or at the start of your next turn.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e-missing-tech-pets.robot-support.Item.16508c1a18d8f627]</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"tank-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"f525670c9703a05c"}
{"_id":"16508c1a18d8f627","name":"Effect: Tank Support","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"effect-tank-support","description":{"value":"<p>Apply to the owner. While active, your next Strike against a foe within the robot’s melee reach gains a +1 circumstance bonus. Toggle off after the Strike; the effect ends at the start of your next turn. Resolve reach and targeting manually.</p>","gm":""},"duration":{"value":1,"unit":"rounds","expiry":"turn-start","sustained":false},"fromSpell":false,"level":{"value":1},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"start":{"initiative":null,"value":0},"tokenIcon":{"show":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]},"unidentified":false,"badge":null,"context":null,"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"tank-support","toggleable":true,"label":"SFMTP.TankSupportToggle"},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"strike-attack-roll","type":"circumstance","value":1,"predicate":["tank-support"]}]},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.sf2e-missing-tech-pets.robot-support.Item.16508c1a18d8f627"},"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"itemEffect":true,"effectId":"effect-tank-support"}}}
{"_id":"5540938c40c07162","name":"Effect: Powerful Support","type":"effect","img":"icons/svg/aura.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"effect-powerful-support","description":{"value":"<p>Apply to the owner. While active, your Strikes that damage creatures within the robot’s melee reach also deal persistent bleed damage: 1d6, or 2d6 if the robot is burly or deft. The effect ends at the start of your next turn. Resolve reach and which Strikes qualify manually.</p>","gm":""},"duration":{"value":1,"unit":"rounds","expiry":"turn-start","sustained":false},"fromSpell":false,"level":{"value":1},"publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"start":{"initiative":null,"value":0},"tokenIcon":{"show":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]},"unidentified":false,"badge":null,"context":null,"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"powerful-support","toggleable":true,"label":"SFMTP.PowerfulSupportToggle"},{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"bleedDice","adjustName":false,"prompt":"SFMTP.PowerfulSupportPrompt","choices":[{"label":"SFMTP.PowerfulSupportNormal","value":1},{"label":"SFMTP.PowerfulSupportSuperior","value":2}]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"strike-damage","category":"persistent","damageType":"bleed","diceNumber":"{item|flags.sf2e.rulesSelections.bleedDice}","dieSize":"d6","predicate":["powerful-support"]}]},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.sf2e-missing-tech-pets.robot-support.Item.5540938c40c07162"},"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"itemEffect":true,"effectId":"effect-powerful-support"}}}
